      "content": "but the static never stops. it's like the city is designed to keep us turning, keeping us grinding away for nothing. it's exhausting kael. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to break. sometimes i wonder if there's a way to just... disconnect. completely. just to make the noise go away for good.",
